    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Brood Brothers Auxilia",
    "summary": "Whenever an **ASTRA MILITARUM** unit of yours is **selected to shoot**, an enemy unit **visible** to it and up to 18\" from it can be picked. If one is, these apply for the rest of the phase:\n\n- the **ASTRA MILITARUM** unit's models can attack only the picked enemy unit, and only while it is a valid target\n- the picked enemy unit counts as **caught in overlapping fire**\n\nRanged attacks by your **GENESTEALER CULTS** models against an enemy unit **caught in overlapping fire** get +1 to [Hit](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls).",
